flowchart TB
    USER[Untrusted requests + model output] --> API[Trusted OIDC / RBAC / tenant + cluster authorization]
    SRC[Untrusted logs / traces] --> API
    API --> READ[Cluster-specific read-only credentials + identity / budget gates]
    API --> EVAL[Evidence verification + deterministic RCA authority]
    API --> DB[(Scoped PostgreSQL / pgvector + audit)]
    subgraph REM[Separate mutation boundary; disabled by default]
      APPROVE[Human approval; distinct approver] --> POLICY[Exact remediator role + policy / dry-run / TTL / drift]
      POLICY --> WRITE[Separate write credentials; scale_deployment / explicit rollback]
    end
    subgraph VAL[Disposable validation only]
      KIND[Kind faults + existing telemetry stack] --> REPORT[Scoped credentials + local reports / cleanup]
    end
